---
metadata:
  layer: task
  scope: "{task_root}/"
  version: "1.0"
  description: "Task definition and acceptance criteria structure"

template:
  required_files:
    - "TASK.md"
  file_structure:
    - "Task title and objectives"
    - "Story list with explicit status"
    - "Acceptance criteria (DoD)"
    - "Dependencies and scope boundaries"
  single_source_of_truth:
    - source: "TASK.md"
      for: "task scope, story breakdown and acceptance details"

agent_rules:
  document_lifecycle:
    state_field: task_state
    states:
      - {id: draft}
      - {id: in_progress}
      - {id: done}
    initial: draft
    terminal: [done]
    transitions:
      - {from: draft, to: in_progress}
      - {from: in_progress, to: done, requires: ["acceptance criteria met"]}
  update_order:
    - "Update task scope and story details as work progresses"
    - "Record story completion with commit references"
    - "Do not infer completion state without verification evidence"
---

# Task / work item

Task definition file, required sections, lifecycle, and the order in which a
task is updated as work progresses.
